<p>aye hyderiyo rehlate hyder ki ye shab hai<br />
be warisi-e aale payambar ki ye shab hai<br />
aye matamiyo ro-o ke mehshar ki ye shab hai<br />
lo waqeya-e- faatahe qaibar ki ye shab hai</p>

<p>kal momino'n ke sar se yadullah uthega<br />
taaboot-e- janabe asadullah uthega<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>lo momino tum hogaye be waris-o- waali<br />
lo dosto hai tum se widaa-e- shah-e- aali<br />
kal subha wo chillayenge hyder ke mawaali<br />
aaj ahmed-e- muqtaar ki masnad huwi qaali</p>

<p>tukde kiye zehra ne girebaan-e kafan ke<br />
koi na raha sar pa hussain aur hassan ke<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>masjid me sitamgaar ne kaabe ko giraya<br />
be qadr shab-e- qadr ka kuch dhyaan na laya<br />
mehraab me qandeel-e imamat ko bujhaya<br />
saidaaniyo'n ko eid ke nazdik rulaya</p>

<p>darda shahe loulaak ke daamaad ko maara<br />
faryaad ke jibreel ke ustad ko maara<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ab waaqeya-e- shere quda karta hu tahreer<br />
qaatil ko pakad laye ju-hi shabbar-o- shabbir<br />
mushke'n thi bandhi kampta tha qouf se bepeer<br />
laanat ki tarha tegh thi qaatil ke gulugeer</p>

<p>rahem aagaya zalim ke larazne pe ali ko<br />
farmaya mere aage se sarkaao shaqi ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>jab le chale qatil ko to bole shah -e- abraar<br />
ye dushmani-e shere quda, aye sag-e makkaar<br />
is maahe mubaarak me kiya zulm jafaakaar<br />
kya teri imamat ka ali tha na sazawaar</p>

<p>ki sharm na mahboob-e- quda se na quda se<br />
le dekh ye rote hai payambar ke nawase<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>tha saath laee'n masjide koofa se saraasar<br />
ghar le chale sibtain-e- nabi sheh ko utha kar<br />
the gird to is laash ke sab shia-e hyder<br />
farzand-e- yateem aage the sar nange barabar</p>

<p>zainab pe yatimi ki musibat jo padi thi<br />
chillati thi sar peet ti thi dar pa khadi thi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>abbas se hyder ne kaha chupke se jaao<br />
haa'n fatima ki beti ko dyodhi se hataao<br />
samjhao ke bas arshe quda ko na hilaao<br />
rehgirou'n ko awaaz na rone ki sunaao</p>

<p>ek waqt ye tha ek wo aafat ki ghadi thi<br />
ran me yahi zainab thi ke sar nange khadi thi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kehte hi be-chain huwe hyder-e- karrar<br />
shabbir ki ghurbat pa jigar hogaya afkaar<br />
ek simt se itne me suna nouha kayi baar<br />
lete the pa uth baithe, ye karte huwe guftaar</p>

<p>kis dard rasidah ki ye faryaad-o- bukaa hai<br />
ye to mere abbas ke rone ki sada hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>rokar kaha moula ne abas isko hai waswaas<br />
kyo'n kyo'n mera abbas nahi aata mere paas<br />
ye sunke phire sar ko jhukaaye huwe abbas<br />
aur baandh ke hatou'n ko ye ki arz basad yaas</p>

<p>wo dard hai mujhko ke ifaaqa nahi baba<br />
in sab ka hai aaqa mera aaqa nahi baba<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>farmaya ali ne ke na ro aye mere dildaar<br />
kyu rote ho jeeta hai abhi hyder -e- karrar<br />
be waaris-o waali tumhe chodunga na zinhaar<br />
lo doulat-e- kounain tumhe deta hai ghaffar</p>

<p>allah salamat rakkhe moula ko tumhare<br />
rootho na bulaata hu mai aaqa ko tumhare<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>phir roke kaha raazi-e taqdeer ko laao<br />
mazloom ko laao shah-e- dilgeer ko laao<br />
shamme lahade saahibe tat'heer ko laao<br />
shabbir ko laao, mere shabbir ko laao</p>

<p>laao use aafat ka falak jis pa girega<br />
sar jiska isi koofe me naize pa phirega<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kehte hi shabbir se ghash kargaye hyder<br />
aur jaanib-e- allah-o payambar gaye hyder<br />
deedaar ke pyase labe kousar gaye hyder<br />
hyder ke pisar rone lage margaye hyder</p>

<p>ghul padh gaya shaa-hinshah-e- zeejaah sidhare<br />
jannat ko jaha'n se asadullah sidhare<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>